    <string name="ai_agent_token_help">Max output limits one reply. The context window includes system instructions, tool definitions, messages and reserved output. AIDE+ estimates 3 characters per token, shortens tool results and drops oldest complete turns only in the request copy. Original saved history, latest user text and call arguments are retained. If they cannot fit, no request is sent: shorten the input, disable unused tools, reduce output or choose the correct model window. This is not exact token counting or an AI-generated summary.</string>
